ci/fuzz/corpus_*-min/
# libFuzzer-generated corpus entries are content-addressed: exactly 40
# lowercase hex characters (SHA1), no extension. Hand-authored seeds under
# corpus_*/ always carry an extension (basic.css, nested.json, ...), so this
# exact-length, no-suffix pattern never touches them (unlike a prefix glob,
# which would also match e.g. deadbeef.css).
ci/fuzz/corpus_*/[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]
ci/t/servroot/
ci/tests/unit/test_scan
*.tar.gz
nginx-*/
